 "lead": "\n",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>AUTOSAR RTE</h2><p class=\"lead\">The RTE realizes the Virtual Functional Bus (VFB) on a specific ECU, providing communication between Software Components and basic software.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Rte_03015\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Rte_Start <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Rte_03015]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> Rte_Start(void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Rte_Start is intended to allocate and initialize system resources and communication resources used by the RTE.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Rte_01262\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Rte_Stop <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Rte_01262]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> Rte_Stop(void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Rte_Stop is used to finalize the RTE on the core it is called. This service releases all system and communication resources allocated by the RTE on that core.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Rte_06753\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Rte_StartTiming <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Rte_06753]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void Rte_StartTiming(void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Rte_StartTiming API is intended to release the activation of RunnableEntitys triggered by TimingEvents and BackgroundEvents after the last call of a Rte_Init function.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Rte_08060\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> SchM_Init <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Rte_08060]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void SchM_Init(const SchM_ConfigType* ConfigPtr);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>SchM_Init is intended to allocate and initialize system resources used by the Basic Software Scheduler part of the RTE for the core on which it is called.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Rte_07273\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> SchM_Start <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Rte_07273]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void SchM_Start(void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Basic Software Scheduler initialized. Shall be called before BswM_Init().</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Rte_04548\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> SchM_StartTiming <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Rte_04548]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void SchM_StartTiming(void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Start periodical events for BSW/SWCs. SchM_Init() has to be called before.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Rte_04551\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> SchM_Deinit <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Rte_04551]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void SchM_Deinit(void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>SchM_Deinit is used to finalize Basic Software Scheduler part of the RTE of the core on which it is called. This service releases all system resources allocated by the Basic Software Scheduler part on that core.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Rte_07277\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> SchM_GetVersionInfo <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Rte_07277]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void SchM_GetVersionInfo(<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>* versioninfo);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Returns the version information of the Basic Software Scheduler.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Rte_89015\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> <nameoftheInvocationHandler> <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Rte_89015]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void <name of the Invocation Handler>(void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Performs invocation of server runnables, hard error runnables, ASCR runnables and triggered runnables via a transformer\".</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Rte_89019\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Rte_Rips_SchM_Deinit <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Rte_89019]</span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void Rte_Rips_SchM_Deinit(void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Rte_Rips_SchM_Deinit deinitializes those RTE Implementation Plug-In parts which are relevant for the SchM related operations.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Rte_91113\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Rte_Rips_SwitchNotificationStatusType <span class=\"sws\">[SWS_Rte_91113]</span></h3>",
